{"id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-qbf-k.md","title":"Bounded-Alternation QBF","display":"df-qbf-k — Bounded-Alternation QBF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-qbf-k","aliases":["28-df-qbf-k","QSAT-k"],"display":"df-qbf-k — Bounded-Alternation QBF","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-tqbf]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-qbf-k"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-qbf-k</span><span>QSAT-k</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qbf-k — Bounded-Alternation QBF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e3545f8c2a4ed307\" href=\"?note=e3545f8c2a4ed307\" title=\"28-df-tqbf\">28-df-tqbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{QBF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}\\)</span>、标准有效前缀语法编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e3545f8c2a4ed307\" href=\"?note=e3545f8c2a4ed307\" title=\"28-df-tqbf\">28-df-tqbf</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q_i^\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf Q_i^\\Sigma\\)</span> 的量词次序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf x_i\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbf x_i\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是有限无重复变量表，各表的变量互不相同。下文按有限列表长度递归定义块构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q\\mathbf x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\mathsf Q\\mathbf x\\,\\varphi\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(\\mathsf Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\alpha_0:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为任一固定总赋值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a> 的布尔公式集和变量集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q\\langle\\rangle\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\mathsf Q(\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\mathbf u)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\mathsf Qx\\,\\bigl(\\mathsf Q\\mathbf u\\,\\varphi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf Q\\langle\\rangle\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\mathsf Q(\\langle x\\rangle^\\frown\\mathbf u)\\,\\varphi\\coloneqq\\mathsf Qx\\,\\bigl(\\mathsf Q\\mathbf u\\,\\varphi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\theta)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\;\\exists\\mathbf x_1,\\ldots,\\mathbf x_k\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta=\\mathsf Q_1^\\Sigma\\mathbf x_1\\cdots\\mathsf Q_k^\\Sigma\\mathbf x_k\\,\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left|\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf x_i)\\right|=\\sum_{i=1}^k|\\mathbf x_i|\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf x_i)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\land\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}(\\theta)=1\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QSAT}_k\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}(\\theta)\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\;\\exists\\mathbf x_1,\\ldots,\\mathbf x_k\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta=\\mathsf Q_1^\\Sigma\\mathbf x_1\\cdots\\mathsf Q_k^\\Sigma\\mathbf x_k\\,\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\left|\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf x_i)\\right|=\\sum_{i=1}^k|\\mathbf x_i|\n\\land\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\bigcup_{i=1}^k\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathbf x_i)\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}\\land\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}(\\theta)=1\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应书中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k\">\\(\\Sigma_k\\)</span>SAT。矩阵允许一般布尔公式，并显式封闭全部自由变量；旧版本遗留的自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}(\\varphi,\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_k\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}(\\varphi,\\langle y_1,\\ldots,y_k\\rangle)\\)</span> 已消除。允许空块等价于至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 块，添加无关变量可使每块非空。末量词全称时不能不经论证强制把矩阵改成带新存在变量的 3CNF，否则会改变交替层数。</p>\n<p>来源核对：例5.6；印刷99页；PDF125页。一般矩阵、变量块和固定交替数已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tqbf","status":"resolved","id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tqbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tqbf","status":"resolved","id":"e3545f8c2a4ed307","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathrm{QBF}$、$\\mathrm{ClosedQBF}$、$\\mathrm{QEval}_{\\alpha_0}$、标准有效前缀语法编码 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm Q}$ 见 [[28-df-tqbf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e